<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith's Food high yield debt.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith's Food high yield debt.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P Morgan said it initiated coverage of Smith's Food &amp; Drug senior subordinated notes as a buy.</p>
<p>-- cited strong cash flow prospects.</p>
<p>-- expects Smith's to generate $70-$90 million in annual free cash flow, after about $60 million a year in cash capital expenditures.</p>
<p>-- expects Smith's to apply free cash flow to reduce debt.</p>
</text>
